PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F144A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G24/25
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with voiceover artist
OL,4,CJon Briggs
OL,5,
OL,6,GRE CONFERENCE WORK: YOU HAVE
OL,7,GINTERVIEWED MANY INTERESTING NAMES `
OL,8,GANY STAND OUT THAT YOU PARTICULARLY
OL,9,GENJOYED MEETING?
OL,11,F"Well Bill Clinton was pretty
OL,12,Ffascinating ` also watching him work
OL,13,Fthe room and schmooze. A very clever
OL,14,Fuser of status and how it can influence
OL,15,Fpeople.
OL,17,F"Buzz Aldrin was very factual about his
OL,18,Famazing feat of walking on the moon `
OL,19,Fbut then these were all military guys.
OL,23,EPub: 12-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,145,140,120,200,0,100
