CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F144A1786056662
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5          G25/25
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CCorrespondence with voiceover artist
OL,4,CJon Briggs
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Highly trained fighter pilots, whose
OL,7,Fjob was not to go all misty eyed about
OL,8,Fthe emotion of the experience ` which
OL,9,Fis why they sound so calm when landing
OL,10,Fat Tranquility Base with only 20
OL,11,Fseconds of fuel remaining, before they
OL,12,Fplummeted into the moon's surface,
OL,13,Fnever to return."
OL,23,EPub: 12-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
